# Force LF in every worktree regardless of core.autocrlf, so text files are
# byte-identical across OSes — CRLF breaks exact \n-string test asserts (Pester)
# and tooling that round-trips these files.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Shell scripts especially: CRLF makes Ubuntu bash fail with "bad interpreter".
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binaries Git must never line-ending-convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
